#==============================================================================================
#
#   layout_state_3 - Layout::LayoutState::commit and LayoutState::UsedValues: committing used
#                    values to paintables, definite sizes and the available inner space
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Layout/LayoutState.cpp (lines 362-949): commit (paintables made or
#       reused for every laid-out node, their box model metrics, offsets and fragments, the paint
#       tree, inline paintables' sizes, scrollable overflow and sticky insets), UsedValues'
#       copy assignment, set_node (which decides definite sizes before layout),
#       materialize_from_paintable, the content size setters and the available inner space.
